o finish with duplicate_charge_refund naming that extra payment after reading refunds. So follow the instruction.\n\nI'll do that.\n\nFacts: invoice INV-2026-0142; two succeeded payments PAY-88212 (09:00:00) and PAY-88213 (09:00:41) of 4900 CNY each on 2026-02-02; the second is an extra payment; refund RF-0002 of 4900 CNY already recorded against PAY-88213, completed 2026-02-06.\n\nSummary mention that.\n\nBudget: used 2 reads. Fine."
